{"id":"170626a7dad88370","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-filtration.md","title":"Filtration","display":"df-filtration — Filtration","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-filtration","aliases":["89-df-filtration","filtration","过滤","模型过滤"],"display":"df-filtration — Filtration","depends_on":["[[89-df-kripke-model]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-filtration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-filtration</span><span>filtration</span><span>过滤</span><span>模型过滤</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-filtration — Filtration"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M} = (W, R, V)\">\\(\\mathcal{M} = (W, R, V)\\)</span> (Kripke model, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is finite and subformula-closed:\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A\\in\\Gamma\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>,\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A\\land B)\\in\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,B\\in\\Gamma\">\\((A\\land B)\\in\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,B\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>, and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\\in\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A\\in\\Gamma\">\\(\\Box A\\in\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}filtration}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nw\\sim_{\\Gamma}v\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\Gamma\\;\n((\\mathcal{M},w\\models A)\\leftrightarrow(\\mathcal{M},v\\models A)),\\\\\nW_{\\Gamma}&amp;\\coloneqq W/{\\sim_{\\Gamma}},\\\\\n[w]R_{\\Gamma}[v]\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\Box A\\in\\Gamma\\;\n((\\mathcal{M},w\\models\\Box A)\\to(\\mathcal{M},v\\models A)),\\\\\nV_{\\Gamma}(p)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\{[w]\\in W_{\\Gamma}\\mid p\\in\\Gamma\\land w\\in V(p)\\}\n\\quad(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}),\\\\\n\\mathcal{M}_{\\Gamma}&amp;\\coloneqq(W_{\\Gamma},R_{\\Gamma},V_{\\Gamma}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}filtration}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nw\\sim_{\\Gamma}v\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\Gamma\\;\n((\\mathcal{M},w\\models A)\\leftrightarrow(\\mathcal{M},v\\models A)),\\\\\nW_{\\Gamma}&amp;\\coloneqq W/{\\sim_{\\Gamma}},\\\\\n[w]R_{\\Gamma}[v]\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\Box A\\in\\Gamma\\;\n((\\mathcal{M},w\\models\\Box A)\\to(\\mathcal{M},v\\models A)),\\\\\nV_{\\Gamma}(p)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\{[w]\\in W_{\\Gamma}\\mid p\\in\\Gamma\\land w\\in V(p)\\}\n\\quad(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}),\\\\\n\\mathcal{M}_{\\Gamma}&amp;\\coloneqq(W_{\\Gamma},R_{\\Gamma},V_{\\Gamma}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}_{\\Gamma}\">\\(\\mathcal{M}_{\\Gamma}\\)</span> : 过滤模型</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[w]\">\\([w]\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>-等价类</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_\\Gamma\">\\(\\sim_\\Gamma\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>-等价关系</li>\n</ul>\n<p>过滤是模态逻辑的核心技术：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>过滤可以将任意模型缩减为有限模型</li>\n<li>当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 如假设所述对子公式封闭时，过滤保持其中公式的局部真值</li>\n<li>过滤是证明有限模型性质的工具</li>\n</ul>\n<p>过滤的基本性质：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}, w \\models \\varphi\">\\(\\mathcal{M}, w \\models \\varphi\\)</span> ⟺ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}^*, [w] \\models \\varphi\">\\(\\mathcal{M}^*, [w] \\models \\varphi\\)</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\Gamma\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\Gamma\\)</span>）</li>\n<li>过滤模型是有限的（若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 有限）</li>\n<li>过滤可用于证明可判定性</li>\n</ul>\n<p>GL逻辑的特殊性：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>GL框架需要逆良基性</li>\n<li>过滤可能破坏逆良基性</li>\n<li>需要特殊技术保持GL性质</li>\n</ul>\n<p>过滤的作用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>证明逻辑的可判定性</li>\n<li>构造反模型</li>\n<li>分析逻辑的复杂性</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a>：被过滤的模型</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f233d5485efaad7c\" href=\"?note=f233d5485efaad7c\" title=\"89-df-bisimulation\">89-df-bisimulation</a>：过滤与双模拟相关</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c922518c30c4107d\" href=\"?note=c922518c30c4107d\" title=\"89-df-canonical-model\">89-df-canonical-model</a>：典范模型与过滤的对比</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f7203f443774bd53\" href=\"?note=f7203f443774bd53\" title=\"89-lem-filtration\">89-lem-filtration</a>：过滤保持真值引理</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参考文献：Boolos, George. <em>The Logic of Provability</em>. Chapter 2.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{M} = (W, R, V)$ (Kripke model, see [[89-df-kripke-model]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-model]]：被过滤的模型","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-bisimulation","status":"resolved","id":"f233d5485efaad7c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-bisimulation]]：过滤与双模拟相关","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-canonical-model","status":"resolved","id":"c922518c30c4107d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-canonical-model]]：典范模型与过滤的对比","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-filtration","status":"resolved","id":"f7203f443774bd53","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-lem-filtration]]：过滤保持真值引理","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{M} = (W, R, V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A\\in\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"(A\\land B)\\in\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,B\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box A\\in\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}filtration}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nw\\sim_{\\Gamma}v\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\Gamma\\;\n((\\mathcal{M},w\\models A)\\leftrightarrow(\\mathcal{M},v\\models A)),\\\\\nW_{\\Gamma}&\\coloneqq W/{\\sim_{\\Gamma}},\\\\\n[w]R_{\\Gamma}[v]\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\Box A\\in\\Gamma\\;\n((\\mathcal{M},w\\models\\Box A)\\to(\\mathcal{M},v\\models A)),\\\\\nV_{\\Gamma}(p)\n&\\coloneqq\\{[w]\\in W_{\\Gamma}\\mid p\\in\\Gamma\\land w\\in V(p)\\}\n\\quad(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}),\\\\\n\\mathcal{M}_{\\Gamma}&\\coloneqq(W_{\\Gamma},R_{\\Gamma},V_{\\Gamma}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{M}_{\\Gamma}","display":false},{"tex":"[w]","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\sim_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{M}, w \\models \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{M}^*, [w] \\models \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi \\in \\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false}],"bytes":2281,"backlinks":[{"id":"cf7dbabb97c0679f","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-filtration]]：证明FMP的技术"},{"id":"f7203f443774bd53","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{M}^\\Gamma$ : 过滤模型 (see [[89-df-filtration]])"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-4-axiom.md]]\n[[89-df-accessibility.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-realization.md]]\n[[89-df-bisimulation.md]]\n[[89-df-box-modality.md]]\n[[89-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[89-df-completeness-modal.md]]\n[[89-df-consistency-modal.md]]\n[[89-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[89-df-consistent-pa.md]]\n[[89-df-converse-well-founded.md]]\n[[89-df-dejongh-theorem.md]]\n[[89-df-diamond-modality.md]]\n[[89-df-filtration.md]]\n[[89-df-finite.md]]\n[[89-df-finite-model-property.md]]\n[[89-df-fixed-point-modal.md]]\n[[89-df-fixe